      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Certainly! As an GDPR-compliant small stationery shop, ensure you have clear consent from customers before collecting their email or address. Keep their data securely and only use it for the stated purpose. For your audit, you'll need to demonstrate your data's safety, how you've obtained and stored the information, and the steps taken to give customers a choice on their data. Finally, inform customers about their rights under GDPR and provide an easy way to retract consent and have their data erased if they wish.",
